    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discord server</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990650/extras/cd72ec37970c80eda36c54a15a6e9376.webp?t=1746888464\" width=614 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Game Content Creation and Streaming Guide]</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your created content includes ending scenes, please include a spoiler warning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is possible for both individuals and corporations, provided that you post a link to the game's store page in the overview or description of your created content.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction/Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Winter Girl&quot; is a visual novel that tells the story of a chance encounter with &quot;Seah,&quot; an alien.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy dates with her as she learns about Earth, and take time to get to know each other. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990650/extras/a06e7803d57ab57d6aa02b4491aaf8f5.poster.avif?t=1746888464\" width=614 height=664 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990650/extras/a06e7803d57ab57d6aa02b4491aaf8f5.webm?t=1746888464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Animated Cutscenes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy Winter Girl's spectacular animated cutscenes and camera direction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't forget the special moments spent with the two heroines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990650/extras/cb63f93b4e9ec28696ec8b55d4e18a63.poster.avif?t=1746888464\" width=614 height=752 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990650/extras/cb63f93b4e9ec28696ec8b55d4e18a63.webm?t=1746888464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990650/extras/cb63f93b4e9ec28696ec8b55d4e18a63.mp4?t=1746888464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choices and Branching Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll progress through the story via conversations and interactions with the two heroines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how to treat her and what to say. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ending will change based on your choices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990650/extras/c023c1897987f2b0969845456fb1bf84.poster.avif?t=1746888464\" width=614 height=672 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990650/extras/c023c1897987f2b0969845456fb1bf84.webm?t=1746888464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990650/extras/c023c1897987f2b0969845456fb1bf84.mp4?t=1746888464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various Entertainment Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with the heroine Lumi through a tablet, and search for sightings of Seah in the world of social media. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also various mini-games prepared for your enjoyment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990650/extras/6d9559cedabb5ff9c7cec60aa06e9138.avif?t=1746888464\" width=614 height=644 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discord server</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990650/extras/cd72ec37970c80eda36c54a15a6e9376.webp?t=1746888464\" width=614 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Game Content Creation and Streaming Guide]</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your created content includes ending scenes, please include a spoiler warning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is possible for both individuals and corporations, provided that you post a link to the game's store page in the overview or description of your created content.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction/Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Winter Girl&quot; is a visual novel that tells the story of a chance encounter with &quot;Seah,&quot; an alien.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy dates with her as she learns about Earth, and take time to get to know each other. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990650/extras/a06e7803d57ab57d6aa02b4491aaf8f5.poster.avif?t=1746888464\" width=614 height=664 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990650/extras/a06e7803d57ab57d6aa02b4491aaf8f5.webm?t=1746888464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Animated Cutscenes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy Winter Girl's spectacular animated cutscenes and camera direction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't forget the special moments spent with the two heroines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990650/extras/cb63f93b4e9ec28696ec8b55d4e18a63.poster.avif?t=1746888464\" width=614 height=752 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990650/extras/cb63f93b4e9ec28696ec8b55d4e18a63.webm?t=1746888464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990650/extras/cb63f93b4e9ec28696ec8b55d4e18a63.mp4?t=1746888464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choices and Branching Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll progress through the story via conversations and interactions with the two heroines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how to treat her and what to say. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ending will change based on your choices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990650/extras/c023c1897987f2b0969845456fb1bf84.poster.avif?t=1746888464\" width=614 height=672 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990650/extras/c023c1897987f2b0969845456fb1bf84.webm?t=1746888464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990650/extras/c023c1897987f2b0969845456fb1bf84.mp4?t=1746888464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various Entertainment Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with the heroine Lumi through a tablet, and search for sightings of Seah in the world of social media. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also various mini-games prepared for your enjoyment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990650/extras/6d9559cedabb5ff9c7cec60aa06e9138.avif?t=1746888464\" width=614 height=644 /></span></p>",
